{"data":"<div class=\"w-100 ck-content\">\n        <h3 style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u7b2c 11 \u8ab2 (Unit 11)<\/strong><br>&nbsp;<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>?I.&nbsp;H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn:&nbsp;h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean xem video 3 l\u1ea7n:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">L\u1ea7n 1 (nghe v\u00e0 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a): xem video v\u00e0 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean t\u00ecnh hu\u1ed1ng trong video.<br>* <i><u>L\u01b0u \u00fd<\/u><\/i>: h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o danh s\u00e1ch t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 ng\u1eef ph\u00e1p \u1edf d\u01b0\u1edbi video \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111o\u00e1n ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a b\u00e0i kh\u00f3a.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">L\u1ea7n 2 (b\u1eaft ch\u01b0\u1edbc): xem video, d\u1eebng t\u1eebng c\u00e2u v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecdc theo. L\u01b0u \u00fd: ng\u1eaft ngh\u1ec9, l\u1ea5y h\u01a1i t\u1ea1i d\u1ea5u \u300c\u3001\u300d\u300c\u3002\u300d.<\/p><\/li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">L\u1ea7n 3 (shadowing): xem video, \u0111\u1ecdc theo (kh\u00f4ng d\u1eebng t\u1eebng c\u00e2u).<\/p><p style=\"text-align:justify;\">&nbsp;<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>?II. N\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc:<\/strong><\/h3><p>&nbsp;<\/p><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>\u30e6\u30cb\u30c3\u30c8\uff11\uff11\u30fb\u8a9e\u5f59\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\uff08\uff11\uff19\u500b\uff09&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>UNIT 11 - DANH S\u00c1CH T\u1eea V\u1ef0NG (19 T\u1eea)<\/strong><\/h3><p style=\"text-align:center;\">&nbsp;<\/p><figure class=\"table\" style=\"width:91.66%;\"><table class=\"ck-table-resized\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:8.79%;\"><col style=\"width:33.02%;\"><col style=\"width:28.99%;\"><col style=\"width:29.2%;\"><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#efefef;border:1px solid #000000;padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;\"><strong>#<\/strong><\/td><td style=\"bac